{
  "slug": "hostinger-connector",
  "name": "Hostinger Connector",
  "url": "https://mcp.hostinger.com/",
  "description": "Connect your Hostinger account to Claude and manage your entire hosting setup through conversation.\n\nWebsites & WordPress — Deploy static sites and Node.js apps, import WordPress websites, install and manage plugins and themes, change PHP versions, manage caches, and monitor deployments.\n\nDomains & DNS — Check domain availability, get AI-powered name suggestions, manage nameservers, forwarding, privacy protection, and WHOIS profiles. Edit DNS zone records or purchase new domains.\n\nVPS — Create and manage virtual machines, snapshots, and backups; configure firewalls, monitoring, and PTR records; install applications from templates; and recover access when things go wrong.\n\nEmail & Email Marketing (Reach) — Manage mailboxes, forwarders, autoreplies, and DNS records for email delivery, plus contacts, tags, and campaigns in Hostinger Reach.\n\nEcommerce — Launch new online stores. Manage products, variants, orders, categories, and sales channels.\n\nBilling & Subscriptions — Review your service catalog, subscriptions, payment methods, and invoices. Never miss a renewal.\n\nEvery tool is annotated as read-only or write, so Claude asks before making changes — read-only requests like \"list my domains\" run freely, while destructive actions such as deleting DNS records always require your approval.\n\nRequires a Hostinger account (hostinger.com). Sign in securely with your Hostinger login via OAuth — no API keys to copy.",
